{"id":9727,"date":"2019-10-30T15:19:08","date_gmt":"2019-10-30T11:19:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/?post_type=news_item&#038;p=9727"},"modified":"2019-11-10T14:20:24","modified_gmt":"2019-11-10T10:20:24","slug":"wom-award-winners","status":"publish","type":"news_item","link":"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/news_item\/wom-award-winners\/","title":{"rendered":"WOM Award Winners"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">WOM applauds the exceptional achievements of its\nemployees through awards at the Biannual Summit. These awards acknowledge not\nonly the hard work of our employees; but also acknowledges their ability,\npassion, effort and above all, excellence.&nbsp;Following were the awards given\nduring our Biannual Summit.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sales:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> <strong>Super Sales Star Award<\/strong>: Recognizes Sales performers that contribute to the top line revenue and growth of the organization. <strong>Ron Tooker was awarded <\/strong>for successfully developing the Mexico market and securing top dollar orders in the region.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/RonTooker.jpg\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/RonTooker.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP\/\/\/yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9728 lazyload\" width=\"617\" height=\"412\"\/><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/RonTooker.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9728\" width=\"617\" height=\"412\" srcset=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/RonTooker.jpg 800w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/RonTooker-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/RonTooker-768x513.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 617px) 100vw, 617px\" \/><\/noscript><\/a><figcaption> <strong>Ron Tooker<\/strong> receiving award from Mr. Sam Puranik, CEO, WOM Group of Companies<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Customer Whisperer Award: <\/strong>Recognizes Sales performers that bring in the highest number of new customers. Awarded to\u00a0<strong>Eddie Darce\u00a0<\/strong>for relentlessly and repeatedly developing new customers in Midland and always advocating the WOM brand.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/EddieDarce.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/EddieDarce.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP\/\/\/yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9730 lazyload\" width=\"618\" height=\"412\"\/><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/EddieDarce.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9730\" width=\"618\" height=\"412\" srcset=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/EddieDarce.jpg 800w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/EddieDarce-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/EddieDarce-768x513.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 618px) 100vw, 618px\" \/><\/noscript><\/a><figcaption>Eddie Darce receiving award from Mrs. Shubhangi Neelesh Musale<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Engineering:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Spotlight Award: <\/strong>Recognizes performers who develop the most innovative design or product. Awarded to\u00a0<strong>Udaya Baskar<\/strong>\u00a0for developing DRS and CCD for the subsea market which has credited WOM as an independent and premier manufacturer in such a specialized space.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/UdayaBhaskar.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/UdayaBhaskar.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP\/\/\/yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9731 lazyload\" width=\"621\" height=\"415\"\/><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/UdayaBhaskar.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9731\" width=\"621\" height=\"415\" srcset=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/UdayaBhaskar.jpg 800w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/UdayaBhaskar-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/UdayaBhaskar-768x513.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 621px) 100vw, 621px\" \/><\/noscript><\/a><figcaption>Udaya Baskar receiving award from Mr. Mansing Phase<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Superstar Award: <\/strong>Recognizes performers who made a big positive impact on global engineering. Awarded to\u00a0<strong>Anand Kalimuthu\u00a0<\/strong>for developing innovative and cost effective designs through rigorous research and development. Anand has also spearheaded many global initiatives on engineering excellence.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/AnandKalimuthu.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/AnandKalimuthu.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP\/\/\/yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9732 lazyload\" width=\"618\" height=\"412\"\/><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/AnandKalimuthu.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9732\" width=\"618\" height=\"412\" srcset=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/AnandKalimuthu.jpg 800w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/AnandKalimuthu-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/AnandKalimuthu-768x513.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 618px) 100vw, 618px\" \/><\/noscript><\/a><figcaption>Anand Kalimuthu receiving Award from Mr. Mahesh Mithran<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Operations:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Highest of High Fives Award:\u00a0 Recognizes performers t<\/strong>hat made a positive impact on ensuring on-time deliveries. Awarded to\u00a0<strong>Raju Mainkar<\/strong>\u00a0for braving extreme challenges for tools &amp; product development at Magnum Forge. The successful trials he championed has helped WOM push through cutting edge solutions in our vast product offerings. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/RajuMainkar.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/RajuMainkar.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP\/\/\/yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9733 lazyload\" width=\"620\" height=\"414\"\/><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/RajuMainkar.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9733\" width=\"620\" height=\"414\" srcset=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/RajuMainkar.jpg 800w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/RajuMainkar-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/RajuMainkar-768x513.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 620px) 100vw, 620px\" \/><\/noscript><\/a><figcaption>Ninad O.K receiving award 