E\u2019s appreciation towards WOMs efforts.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/SiddeshwarHawanale.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/SiddeshwarHawanale.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP\/\/\/yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9735 lazyload\" width=\"619\" height=\"413\"\/><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/SiddeshwarHawanale.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9735\" width=\"619\" height=\"413\" srcset=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/SiddeshwarHawanale.jpg 800w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/SiddeshwarHawanale-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/SiddeshwarHawanale-768x513.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 619px) 100vw, 619px\" \/><\/noscript><\/a><figcaption> Mandar Phatak receiving award on behalf of  Siddeshwar Hawanale  from Mr. Doug Ayrton<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Community Service Awards:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Your Energy Inspires Us Award: <\/strong>Recognizes leaders who have truly led from the front and have actively campaigned WOM&#8217;s vision. Awarded to<strong>\u00a0Bhakti Salunkhe <\/strong>for truly inspiring and leading the next generation through WOMs Puranik Foundation. She has been instrumental in aiding opportunities for the foundation in India and the US.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/BhaktiSalunkhe.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/10\/BhaktiSalunkhe.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODl